<title>USA: Mylex says adopts shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Mylex says adopts shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mylex Corp said Wednesday its board adopted a shareholders rights plan and with a 20 percent trigger.</p>
<p>The company said it declared a dividend distribution of one common stock purchase right for each outstanding share of common stock outstanding on May 23.</p>
<p>The company said it is not aware of any takeover efforts, and the plan is only a precaution.</p>
</text>
